iv class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1457251-saints-monsters-preview?p=1457735#post1457735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Miracle-Worker sounds like it should be interesting. I really want this book so I can finish my write up for the Tzabaoth (Abrahamic Host of Heaven) including their reliance of Saints and Prophets as agents in lieu of Scions, as well as their playable forbidden Scions (Nephilim).</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> I would be VERY interested in reading you Abrahamic Host, even if you would have problem putting it as Storypath Nexus. Just PM me files if you would want too publish. ( Last 2 weeks ago someone put their Montheistic Pantheon on Nexus - it lasted only 2 hours, I could not even download it, as I were on the road, in my car. \ud83d\ude12 )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-27T12:17:46-07:00","id":1457811,"title":"","co