?</div> </div> </div> </div>Chances are,next Thursday we'll get a preview of sorcerers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-02T09:39:29-07:00","id":1458367,"title":"","content":"Denizens - are all about fantastic creatures from mythology that, apart from gods, fill the Scion's World - elves, centaurs, trolls, etc. In the expansion's rules, they will be a special Path to take, which has its own unique Conditions, Knacks, and sometimes unique Purview (as a special magic). An example is the Fair Folk, which are European elves and Middle Eastern genies. The mechanics are interesting and elegant. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> I think if Denizen Path takes place of Role Path - you still can have Denizen Scion, with Pantheon Path? Or could it also get's Saints and Prophets Path to a mix, as 4th Path for character?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-02T13:37:44-07:00","id":1458406,"title":"","content":"Denizen Puviews opens some doors (for example non-Scion Giants being able to wield Epic Strength innately)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material